{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-09-21 09:59:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS ANNOUNCES ITS FIRST WIND ENERGY PROJECT IN IOWA - 207-MW LEDYARD WINDPOWER', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., SEPT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS,* A NONREGULATED COMMERCIAL BRAND OF DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CONSTRUCTION OF THE 207-MEGAWATT (MW) LEDYARD WINDPOWER PROJECT IN KOSSUTH COUNTY, IOWA.'}